      "flavor": "\"Amateurs feign it as 'random packet loss'. They do this for safety. They do this out of fear. But why should we cower? <em>We</em> will collapse the Corporatocracy, piece by piece! They are not the ones to fear. <em>We</em> are.\"\n- Freedom Khumalo",
